Write a program that takes a string, and displays the string in reverse followed by a newline.
If the number of parameters is not 1, the program displays a newline.
void   ft_rev_print(int argc, char **argv)
{
  int   i;

  i = 0;
  while (argv[1][i] != '\0')
    i++;
  while (i > 0)
  {
    i--;
    write(1, &argv[1][i], 1);
  }
  write(1, "\n", 1);
}
